WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:08,000
There is no other life to live here for the time being.

2
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:21,680
What is that zombie?

3
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:22,840
Why are you surrounded by it?

4
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:24,920
I've been living there with my parents and my boyfriend

5
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:26,880
The monster suddenly appeared and disappeared

6
00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:28,560
Killed my boyfriend and parents

7
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:29,480
Still want to kill me

8
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:31,120
She said it was a personal grudge

9
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:32,900
did you know her before

10
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:36,970
Only then would I know that kind of monster

11
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:39,200
That murderous madman

12
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:41,680
You rest first
